WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.025
Check yourself with two questions.

2
00:00:02.025 --> 00:00:06.087
First: a workload stays on
premises and needs Kerberos.

3
00:00:06.087 --> 00:00:09.923
The domain has a Windows
Server 2025 domain controller,

4
00:00:09.923 --> 00:00:14.676
but one of the two hosts that run the
service is on Windows Server 2022.

5
00:00:14.676 --> 00:00:15.737
What's the target?

6
00:00:15.737 --> 00:00:18.575
The answer is b, a G M S A.

7
00:00:18.575 --> 00:00:24.163
A D M S A needs every host that
uses it on Windows Server 2025.

8
00:00:24.163 --> 00:00:30.251
Second: Learn's Entra page ends a move to
a G M S A by deleting the old account.

9
00:00:30.251 --> 00:00:31.675
What does the program do?

10
00:00:31.675 --> 00:00:32.900
The answer is b.

11
00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:36.718
It disables the account after a
clean thirty-day parallel run,

12
00:00:36.718 --> 00:00:40.462
and deletes it only later,
through the decommission process.

13
00:00:40.462 --> 00:00:42.824
The program follows the stricter reading.

14
00:00:42.824 --> 00:00:45.252
The module page has three more questions,

15
00:00:45.252 --> 00:00:47.810
each linked to the
section that answers it.
